;; The overload resolution reimplements, for the native trees, jdk26u
;; (https://github.com/openjdk/jdk26u at baf63fbe42b8758448fee570a9d9bb914272d259)'s
;; src/jdk.compiler/share/classes/com/sun/tools/javac/comp/Resolve.java (isAccessible of classes and
;; of members, isProtectedAccessible, isInnerSubClass, notOverriddenIn, rawInstantiate without
;; inference, resolveMethodCheck's argumentsAcceptable and checkArg, MethodCheckContext.compatible,
;; MethodResultInfo.check, selectBest, mostSpecific, signatureMoreSpecific, adjustArgs, MostSpecificCheck,
;; ambiguityError, AmbiguityError.mergeAbstracts, findMethodInScope and its LookupFilter, findMethod with
;; its InterfaceLookupPhase and superclasses, findFun, the import scopes' methods, lookupMethod,
;; LookupHelper.shouldStop, MethodResolutionPhase.mergeResults, resolveMethod, resolveQualifiedMethod,
;; resolveConstructor, findConstructor), code/Types.java (isSubtypeUnchecked, isConvertible,
;; cvarUpperBound, cvarLowerBound, hasSameArgs, isSubSignature, overrideEquivalent,
;; returnTypeSubstitutable, resultSubtype, covariantReturnType, mergeAbstracts with its
;; MostSpecificReturnCheck, implementation, isDerivedRaw, rank, closure, insert, union), code/Symbol.java
;; (MethodSymbol.overrides, isOverridableIn, TypeSymbol.precedes, baseSymbol), comp/Check.java (intersect,
;; importAccessible), code/Scope.java (SymbolImporter's order of a static import's members) and
;; comp/TypeEnter.java (AnonClassConstructorHelper, BasicConstructorHelper, staticImportFilter); and, the
;; inference tier's (JN9d), Resolve.java's resolveDiamond, findDiamond, resolveMemberReference,
;; getMemberReference, the reference lookup helpers, ReferenceLookupResult, the reference choosers,
;; arityMethodCheck and nilMethodCheck, and Types.java's findDescriptorSymbol, findDescriptorType,
;; removeWildcards, interfaceCandidates, prune, overridesObjectMethod and membersClosure, whose notice
;; follows (LICENSE.md, "OpenJDK (jdk26u)"):
